sequenceDiagram
  participant Reader
  participant Edge
  participant Web
  participant API
  participant DB as Main database
  participant Queue as Render jobs
  participant Worker as Render worker
  participant Assets
  Reader->>Edge: HTTPS page request
  Edge->>Web: Forward request
  Web->>API: Read workspace
  API->>DB: Tenant-scoped query
  DB-->>API: Workspace data
  API-->>Web: Response
  Web-->>Reader: Page
  Reader->>API: Request an export
  API->>Queue: Enqueue accepted job
  API-->>Reader: Job identifier
  Queue->>Worker: Deliver job
  Worker->>DB: Read source
  Worker->>Assets: Write rendered output
